From: Wrynose migration
Subject: [PATCH] hciattach: use /lib/firmware for BCM43xx firmware

The FIRMWARE_DIR definition is in hciattach_bcm43xx.c in BlueZ 5.48.
Use the system firmware directory instead of the obsolete /etc/firmware.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Raspberry Pi firmware path]

---
 tools/hciattach_bcm43xx.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/tools/hciattach_bcm43xx.c b/tools/hciattach_bcm43xx.c
index 5d54fc2..ae6304b 100644
--- a/tools/hciattach_bcm43xx.c
+++ b/tools/hciattach_bcm43xx.c
@@ -46 +46 @@
-#define FIRMWARE_DIR "/etc/firmware"
+#define FIRMWARE_DIR "/lib/firmware"
--
2.34.1
